message: "If you use this research software, please cite it using these metadata."

type: software

title: "Permutation-Based Multiple Testing under Dependence"

abstract: >-
  R research software for investigating multiple hypothesis testing
  under dependence, including permutation-based calibration,
  sign-flipping methods, e-values, and closed testing procedures.
  The software supports simulation studies evaluating false
  discovery rate, family-wise error rate, and statistical power.

